			"local_notes": "Lore: A more modern, compact production pattern seen in recent Codex-era background art and Black Library description as lighter and shorter in the receiver than the older Godwyn and Umbra lines, without any suggestion it hits softer.\n\nDesign: Same anchor damage as every standard boltgun; only weight (2 lb lighter) and Bulk (-3 instead of -4, for the shorter receiver) move, reflecting a newer, more compact build rather than a different cartridge.",
