		{
			"id": "e4H1nPzgeJl4u1HPp",
			"description": "Heavy Bolter",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The Imperium's standard support-weapon bolter, tripod- or vehicle-mounted, firing an oversized bolt round; consistently shown chewing through infantry and light vehicles alike while remaining useless against a main battle tank's frontal armour.\n\nDesign: This is the project's second fixed anchor: 8d(2) pi+, follow-up 4d cr ex. Checked against the vehicle armour table: AV10 (DR 50, e.g. a Sentinel or a Chimera's side) has effective DR 25 against the armour divisor (2); 8d(2) averages 28, so it does get through and \"chews\" light vehicles as required. AV12 (DR 120, a Chimera's front) has effective DR 60, comfortably out of reach of an average roll of 28, so it does not reliably hurt medium-armoured vehicles - both outcomes match the assignment's check. ST 14 and ROF 6 reflect a genuine support weapon needing a mount or a very strong shooter (only Astartes or a braced tripod).",
			"tags": [
				"Missile Weapon",
				"Imperium",
				"Astra Militarum",
				"Adeptus Astartes"
			],
			"tech_level": "10",
			"legality_class": "1",
			"base_value": "3500",
			"base_weight": "60 lb",
