		{
			"id": "ehva59lZ6SVXemgvz",
			"description": "Bolt Rifle, Primaris Pattern",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Introduced with the Primaris Space Marines, current Codex background describes the bolt rifle as firing a slightly more powerful cartridge with improved sights and effective range compared with a legacy boltgun, without claiming it is a different order of weapon.\n\nDesign: One pip over the Godwyn anchor (6d+1(2) pi+ / 3d+1 cr ex follow-up) for the \"more powerful cartridge\" the Codex claims, plus a real jump in Acc (5 vs 4) and range (300/1200 vs 200/1000) for the improved optics and barrel. Magazine capacity (20) sits below the legacy boltgun's 24 to reflect the bulkier round in the same-size housing.",
