		{
			"id": "eYsHQeD5CdFO7yKhH",
			"description": "Auto Bolt Rifle, Primaris Pattern",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A Primaris pattern optimised for volume of fire over range, background material frames it as trading the bolt rifle's reach for a much higher cyclic rate, closer in role to an assault weapon than the standard bolt rifle's designated-marksman feel.\n\nDesign: Standard Godwyn-anchor damage (the cartridge itself is not upgraded, unlike the Primaris bolt rifle above) with RoF doubled to 6 and a bigger 30-round magazine, at the cost of Acc and range falling below even a legacy boltgun to reflect the shorter, gas-hungrier barrel that lore says trades reach for volume.",
