		{
			"id": "e-3zdcRJirOB-HDjz",
			"description": "Stalker Bolt Rifle, Primaris Pattern",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A precision, semi-automatic-only bolt rifle firing subsonic ammunition for use by Vanguard Primaris squads and scout patterns operating covertly; background stresses stealth and one-shot precision over rate of fire.\n\nDesign: Penetrator dice are unchanged from the Godwyn anchor (the subsonic load does not need to lose penetration to stay quiet), but the follow-up drops from 3d cr ex to 2d cr ex: a subsonic round has less kinetic energy at impact to trigger a full-yield detonation of the internal charge. Acc is the best of any weapon on this page (integral optics, single shots only, RoF 1) and Bulk is worse (-5) for the built-in suppressor/barrel shroud.",
