		{
			"id": "elz-ZNiZCromC961U",
			"description": "Combi-Weapon, Bolter/Plasma",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Combi-weapons fuse a standard boltgun with a single-shot auxiliary barrel of a rarer special weapon, common Astartes wargear (especially for Chaplains, Sergeants and Deathwatch Space Marines) when a squad needs one extra answer to armour or a specific threat without giving up bolter fire entirely.\n\nDesign: The bolter barrel is the Godwyn anchor with a reduced magazine (20 vs 24) to make room for the auxiliary mechanism; the plasma barrel reuses the plasma gun's standard-mode damage line unchanged (see Plasma Weapons) since it is the same cartridge in a smaller reservoir, just good for one shot per reload.",
